unpunctuated contractions, interjections and emphatic punctuation are positive.
Dictionary senses extend 'and so on' to Chinese and Japanese. Code syntax
reduces the ampersand response. Separate first-token rules include a positive
tab exception. Repeated middle-dot separators and a few common words have
negative offsets.
