"""Orthographic continuation pulses, mostly in finely split non-Latin words.

An opening Title: field is a large positive special case. Arabic elongation
and vowel marks are negative. Short Cyrillic consonant clusters are positive,
especially capitals and the v- prefix; Ukrainian i and Bulgarian hard vowels
are negative. Most ordinary text gets a near-zero value.
