First headings and table rows give positive pulses which fade later in the
page. Forum counters/timestamps and several metadata delimiters are negative.
Opening code syntax and broad opening-token classes have separate offsets;
a leading run of identical tokens keeps its opening offset. This deliberately
leaves ordinary word-specific variation at a small background value.
